<title>GREECE: GREEK AMBASSADOR AMONG PERU HOSTAGES.</title>
<headline>GREEK AMBASSADOR AMONG PERU HOSTAGES.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's ambassador to Peru is among 200 hostages held by armed guerrillas at the Japanese ambassador's residence in Lima, Greek foreign ministry officials said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>They said ambassador Alkiviades Karokis was held with scores of other diplomats and officials by Cuban-inspired Tupac Amaru Revolutionary Movement (MRTA) guerrillas.</p>
<p>The guerrillas began their attack on Tuesday night firing a rocket and spraying gunfire into the building.</p>
<p>They demand the release of jailed comrades.</p>
</text>
